    <div class="unique-section">
      <h3>Location</h3>
      <p>Easy connectivity, centrally located in Vastrapur, the heart of Ahmedabad, close to various modes of public transport like bus services, BRTS and Ahmedabad Metro.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="unique-section">
      <h3>Patient Rooms</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Centrally air-conditioned hospital with different types of rooms like Executive, Super Deluxe, Deluxe, Economy & Premium Economy offering the best of facilities in each room.</li>
        <li>DHS Multispecialty Hospital has 50 beds. Each bed is equipped with ergonomic & emergency safety features. Bed-side X-Ray and Sonography is possible at every bed.</li>
        <li>Premium rooms are equipped with TV, fridge and a microwave oven. A separate area is allocated for visitors.</li>
        <li>All toilets are wheelchair accessible, with emergency nurse call system.</li>
        <li>Automated Nurse, Attendant & Canteen call system with emergency indicators are located in each room.</li>
        <li>Fresh air system in all rooms and all areas of the hospital with bacteria-free centrally air-conditioning.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="unique-section">
      <h3>Hospital Equipment</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Three state-of-the-art modular class-100 operation theatres with Laminar airflow systems and static electricity resistant flooring; all imported from Germany.</li>
        <li>Anaesthesia workstation and advanced Laparoscopy systems procured from the USA.</li>
        <li>Eight-bed Intensive Care Unit (ICU) with HEPA filter system. Ventilators of GE make.</li>
        <li>Central monitoring system in the ICU facilitates continuous patient care.</li>
        <li>Separate Isolation Wards with Negative & Positive pressure-based air circulation.</li>
        <li>4MHU, low-dose radiation Japanese 16-Multislice CT Scanner gives high-quality images.</li>
        <li>X-Ray: 300mA high frequency fixed and 100mA portable X-Ray units.</li>
        <li>3D-4D Sonography, Colour Doppler & 2D Echocardiography.</li>
        <li>Fully fledged Pathology Laboratory with fully automated analysers.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

